        Status      | Case Count | Percentage of Count
        Draft       |      7     |  43.75%
        Closed      |      2     |  12.5%
        In Progress |      2     |  12.5%
        Open        |      2     |  12.5%
        Resolved    |      2     |  12.5%
        Pending     |      1     |   6.25%
        Total       |     16     | 100%
        (16 cases were present at measurement time: the 13 package rows
